# Normalize all text files to LF line endings — in the repo and on checkout.
# Overrides core.autocrlf so Windows checkouts don't get CRLF (silences the
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings on these markdown skill files).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Markdown is the bulk of this repo — be explicit.
*.md text eol=lf
